Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||10-29-2001||01:14 PM||||I didn't put this in the mall section cause I am not getting rid of them just yet. I am still waiting on my 7inchers. But I was bored and I took my wing off today in hopes it doesn't rain anytime soon and just to see what it looks like with no wing and hope they ship in the next day or so. I would suggest to take off the wing if you hadn't. I don't think mine has been taken off. I think it would be a good idea to clean under the rubber parts cause it was pretty dirty and rusty. The car sure does look different with no wing, I kinda like the look, makes the fiero look smoother but I don't think I could go without a wing for long. I'll give my self 1 day at the most  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P> But anyways, when these new ones come in I guess I have no need for them. they are white and they are in perfect shape. Just the screws and the holes are rusty and the rubber part is warped and has stretched from wraping around the bottom stand. But the stands them self can be prepped and painted to look new I am sure. no cracks or anything. I can't provide any pics cause of no camera  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. But if anyone is interested let me know and I'll keep you in mind when these dumbs stands do decide to come knocking on my door.||||reg||1
